       WinUI's Common_themeresources_any.xaml (microsoft-ui-xaml, fetched
       2026-11-05); that file keys its dark values "Default", which the
       vendored authoring rules ban, so they are re-keyed "Dark" here.
       HighContrast maps each catalog key onto the SystemColor* pairing
       table; the SystemColor* and SystemAccentColor defaults are the
       classic palette mirrored by Uno's SystemResources.xaml, because the
       PoC does not read live OS colors. Accent fill secondary/tertiary
       bake the official Opacity 0.9/0.8 into the color alpha; HC brushes
       never carry opacity. The Acrylic brush family is deferred to the
       materials milestone (flyouts/menus, M6). -->
